<title>USA: MasterCard closes acquisition of Mondex majority.</title>
<headline>MasterCard closes acquisition of Mondex majority.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MasterCard International on Monday said it completed its acquisition of a 51 percent stake in Mondex International.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. U.K.-based Mondex, owned by a group of banks and AT&amp;T Corp, makes a payment card embedded wit a computer chip. The cards are commonly referred to as smart cards.</p>
<p>As a result of the transaction, Mondex becomes a subsidiary of MasterCard.</p>
</text>
